description = "A framed front-desk record sheet lists the current room assignments:

1101 - Vivian Marlowe. Live-in owner; private apartment.
1102 - Felix Vance. Royal Suite; checked in for the auction.
1103 - Vacant. Between guests.
1201 - Ghostbusters team room. Dr. Iris Thorne and Dr. Otis Pemberton.
1202 - Ghostbusters team room. Mara Bell and Theo Griggs.
1203 - Vacant. Between guests.
1204 - Julian Vane. Guest room."
